   S. and Solit, David B. and Jones, David R. and Gomez, Daniel and Yu,
   Helena and Chakravarty, Debyani and Yaeger, Rona and Abida, Wassim and
   Park, Wungki and O'Reilly, Eileen M. and Garcia-Aguilar, Julio and
   Socci, Nicholas and Sanchez-Vega, Francisco and Carrot-Zhang, Jian and
