   Luczaj, Lukasz; Duda, Magdalena, Univ Rzeszow, Inst Appl Biotechnol \& Basic Sci, Dept Bot, PL-36100 Kolbuszowa, Poland.
   Adamczak, Artur, Inst Nat Fibres \& Med Plants, Dept Bot Breeding \& Agr Technol, PL-62064 Plewiska Near Poznan, Poland.},
ISSN = {1641-1307},
